      "sub": "Venom #13–15 · a detour, and not Cates'",
      "intro": "War of the Realms was a line-wide 2019 event: Malekith the Accursed invades Earth with the armies of the ten realms and every hero fights a war on a different front. These three issues are Venom's corner of it, written by Cullen Bunn rather than Cates.\n\nNothing in the main run depends on them. They are here for completeness — skip to the next section without consequence.",
