      "sub": "the setup · read before the event",
      "intro": "Cletus Kasady is a serial killer who bonded with the symbiote's offspring and became Carnage — stronger than Venom, without any of the parts of Eddie that pull him back. His 1993 rampage through New York is the story people mean when they call him Marvel's worst. He has died more than once, and he is dead when this run opens.\n\nThat is the whole briefing. What matters going in is that he is a murderer with a symbiote, and that every symbiote leaves a trace in a host it has bonded with — which is about to be a problem for everyone who has ever worn one.",
